{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01LKdRJYd3LRsG55p5rAvzZk", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://sikarsa.um.ac.id/storage/data_cp/cp_igZiYw2aDE_160724_1721105946.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://eprints.umm.ac.id/id/eprint/15502/103/BAB%20IV.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://jatimtimes.com/baca/218102/20200706/202800/privacy\"}, {\"url\": \"https://idr.uin-antasari.ac.id/30928/7/BAB%20IV.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://idr.uin-antasari.ac.id/15662/7/BAB%20IV.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://idr.uin-antasari.ac.id/10338/7/BAB%20IV.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://idr.uin-antasari.ac.id/11272/10/LAMPIRAN.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://idr.uin-antasari.ac.id/3323/7/BAB%20IV%20KARIMAH.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://idr.uin-antasari.ac.id/29226/7/BAB%20IV.pdf\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:29:16.329Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "kepala sekolah pertama SMP Negeri 14 Malang sejarah", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_012MdR9JkrEpJWVxaBsF8CX8", "content": [{"title": "cp igZiYw2aDE 160724 1721105946", "url": "https://sikarsa.um.ac.id/storage/data_cp/cp_igZiYw2aDE_160724_1721105946.pdf"}, {"title": "eprints.umm.ac.id", "url": "https://eprints.umm.ac.id/id/eprint/15502/103/BAB%20IV.pdf"}, {"title": "free web hit counter", "url": "https://jatimtimes.com/baca/218102/20200706/202800/privacy"}, {"title": "idr.uin-antasari.ac.id", "url": "https://idr.uin-antasari.ac.id/30928/7/BAB%20IV.pdf"}, {"title": "uin-antasari.ac.id", "url": "https://idr.uin-antasari.ac.id/15662/7/BAB%20IV.pdf"}, {"title": "uin-antasari.ac.id", "url": "https://idr.uin-antasari.ac.id/10338/7/BAB%20IV.pdf"}, {"title": "idr.uin-antasari.ac.id", "url": "https://idr.uin-antasari.ac.id/11272/10/LAMPIRAN.pdf"}, {"title": "uin-antasari.ac.id", "url": "https://idr.uin-antasari.ac.id/3323/7/BAB%20IV%20KARIMAH.pdf"}, {"title": "idr.uin-antasari.ac.id", "url": "https://idr.uin-antasari.ac.id/29226/7/BAB%20IV.pdf"}]}, "The search didn't find the first principal of SMP Negeri 14 Malang or any founding history for the school.\n\nThe only SMP Negeri 14 Malang reference is a 2020 article listing 60 Kepala Sekolah TK, SD, SMP Negeri Kota Malang who were inaugurated that year. It names Drs Sukarji MPd, Kepala SMP Negeri 14 Malang as one of them. That tells us who led the school in 2020, not who led it first.\n\nThe other results are about different schools. Several cover SMP Negeri 8 Malang, a school with a detailed history of its principals, but that isn't SMP Negeri 14. Others cover SMP Negeri 14 Banjarmasin in Kalimantan, which is a separate school.\n\nA search for the school's founding decree, or a principal list from its official profile on Dapodik or the Malang city education office (Disdikbud Kota Malang), would be the next step to find the first principal."], "durationSeconds": 5.258379166000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01LKdRJYd3LRsG55p5rAvzZk", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
