%20.pdf"}, {"title": "jim.unisma.ac.id", "url": "https://jim.unisma.ac.id/index.php/fai/article/download/23527/17592"}]}, "The search didn't return any information about SMPN 14 Malang, including its founding, history, or list of principals. The results were about other schools:\n\n- **SMPN 8 Malang:** Results describe its history. One source says the school started in 1950 as a vocational school, SMEP (Sekolah Menengah Ekonomi Pertama) Negeri Malang. Another lists its principals, including Bapak Utomo and Soebekti Harjosantoso. It may be the school you meant, so check the spelling.\n- **SMPN 14 Banjarmasin:** A different school in Kalimantan Selatan. One source says it was once named SMP Negeri Banua Hanyar and was officially established under SK opening No: 0219/0/1981 on 14 July 1981.\n\nA follow-up search with terms like \"SMPN 14 Kota Malang\" or \"sejarah SMP Negeri 14 Malang\" might find the right school. The school's official website or Dapodik data would be the most reliable sources for its principal history."], "durationSeconds": 6.105535, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01AP6XQbDWe1G7yoUtiddg6i", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
